  "volume": 65,
  "totalSec": 161.488,
  "teachEndSec": 100.792,
  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "exam_context.student_facing_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先给你一个安全题的考试视角:它不是问架子搭没搭完,而是问能不能放行。脚手架、模板支架这类题,最容易丢在一句话:未经验收,就先使用或先浇筑。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 12.984,
      "requestId": "de29d0eb-a522-9739-82b9-3c6699ae1813",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.wrong_idea",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最危险的错觉是:现场看着挺稳,可以先干,验收资料后补。考试里这样写,基本就把安全控制点放掉了。搭完,不等于能用。",
      "startSec": 13.384,
      "durSec": 11.256,
      "requestId": "5a91ccc9-7993-908c-8a22-6d9a11097845",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "object",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[object].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一刀,先判对象。题干出现脚手架、现浇混凝土模板支撑系统,就要立刻想到:这是设备设施安全验收检查的对象,不是普通外观检查。",
      "startSec": 25.04,
      "durSec": 12.432,
      "requestId": "6bfcbb8a-ba85-9f8f-9d74-4168cec8251e",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "timing",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[timing].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第二刀,再看时点。搭设完成后、使用前、浇筑前,都是放行门。支撑脚手架搭设过程中到规定高度,也要分阶段验收,不能一口气搭到最后再说。",
      "startSec": 37.872,
      "durSec": 13.104,
      "requestId": "19853583-1e52-9b19-9f13-4c967b8e0cbc",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "acceptance",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[acceptance].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第三刀,看验收闭环。只说检查过不够,只说看着稳定也不够。要有验收合格、形成记录、签字确认。缺一个,都不能把它当成已放行。",
      "startSec": 51.376,
      "durSec": 11.664,
      "requestId": "e4185742-b98e-9233-ae18-a1a1b640dc57",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "outcome",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.outcomes[stop_rectify].label",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "回到题干:模板支架准备浇筑,但验收记录还没有签字。结论不是先浇筑,而是停止放行,完成验收签字;不合格处整改后复验。",
      "startSec": 63.44,
      "durSec": 11.328,
      "requestId": "6c8247d1-6a37-9d19-8919-a1551c72df28",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后写成采分句:脚手架或模板支架搭设完成后,应按专项施工方案和规范要求组织验收;验收合格并形成记录、签字确认后,方可使用或浇筑。",
      "startSec": 75.168,
      "durSec": 13.608,
      "requestId": "667533d1-c016-9ab2-894b-07ed48c3e86c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "bridge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记忆钩子就一句:搭完不等于能用。考试只走四步,对象、时点、验收、放行。后面换成脚手架、支撑脚手架,也按这四步判。",
      "startSec": 89.176,
      "durSec": 11.616,
      "requestId": "3fbb2521-9944-934c-b742-0bf7b74116fc",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师,如果现场已经检查过,只是签字没补,也不能先浇筑吗?",
      "startSec": 101.192,
      "durSec": 4.88,
      "requestId": "ce768b04-ed63-9716-b08c-9f74af89f12c",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[afterward_signature].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能。考试看的是验收闭环,不是口头说检查过。记录和签字没有完成,就不能写成已经验收合格。",
      "startSec": 106.472,
      "durSec": 8.904,
      "requestId": "501c77cc-fe2f-9963-bdff-d3e173b4c73a",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那这张卡只适合模板支架吗?换成脚手架会不会又不一样?",
      "startSec": 115.776,
      "durSec": 4.72,
      "requestId": "d748d13a-dc3b-9916-8ea6-b9a4a6722fe7",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "exam_context.exam_action",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "判法一样。你先认对象,再看时点,再看验收闭环,最后写能不能放行。具体验收阶段和检查内容会换,但这个判断模板不变。",
      "startSec": 120.896,
      "durSec": 11.28,
      "requestId": "23cd95de-869a-9f08-b8d5-abbb3d796248",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "主观题我怎么写才不像口水话?",
      "startSec": 132.576,
      "durSec": 1.92,
      "requestId": "e442483b-09d8-9d76-8877-7b46ef3a41ff",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "deep_archetype.score_atoms",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "按四个采分原子写:对象是什么,到了什么放行时点,验收是否合格并签字,最后能不能使用或浇筑。四个原子齐了,表达就稳。",
      "startSec": 134.896,
      "durSec": 11.784,
      "requestId": "06972aa8-f946-9571-84cd-bd1caa0758c4",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.warm_correction",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "收个尾:你能想到要检查架体,方向已经对了一半。真正得分的是再补两个词:验收合格、签字确认。现在进闯关,换几个题干,看你能不能把放行门守住。",
      "startSec": 147.08,
      "durSec": 13.608,
      "requestId": "19cecade-8f7c-9331-b044-34ad54eb8245",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}